        },
        {
          "text": "Details Of Your Core Achievement In 2026 And Business Impact (Including Financial Figures)",
          "family": "\"Award Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", Arial, sans-serif",
          "size": "18px",
          "weight": "700",
          "lineHeight": "27px",
          "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
        },
        {
          "text": "How You Demonstrate BD China Culture (Especially On You Applied Category) ?",
          "family": "\"Award Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", Arial, sans-serif",
          "size": "18px",
          "weight": "700",
          "lineHeight": "27px",
          "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
        }
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Improved customer response time by twenty percent through coordinated digital workflows.",
          "family": "\"Award Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", Arial, sans-serif",
          "size": "16px",
          "weight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "28.8px",
          "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
        },
        {
          "text": "跨团队协作让客户等待时间缩短，结果经过实际数据核对。",
          "family": "\"Award Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", Arial, sans-serif",
          "size": "16px",
          "weight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "28.8px",
          "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
        },
        {
          "text": "The team reduced waiting time, improved service quality and shared the solution with partner teams in 2026.",
          "family": "\"Award Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", Arial, sans-serif",
          "size": "16px",
          "weight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "28.8px",
          "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
        },
        {
          "text": "The same measured workflow now supports multiple departments without duplicate work. 通过共享流程，提高了服务质量并减少重复工作。",
          "family": "\"Award Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", Arial, sans-serif",
          "size": "16px",
          "weight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "28.8px",
          "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
        },
        {
          "text": "We listened to customers, shared ownership and worked across functions to deliver measurable value.",
          "family": "\"Award Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", Arial, sans-serif",
          "size": "16px",
          "weight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "28.8px",
          "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
        },
        {
          "text": "我们持续倾听客户反馈，将经验分享给其他团队，形成长期合作。",
          "family": "\"Award Sans\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", Arial, sans-serif",
          "size": "16px",
          "weight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "28.8px",
